{"id":446,"slug":"modal-020","category_slug":"modal","name":"可关闭提示弹窗","description":"点击遮罩关闭","tags":["Modal","交互","关闭","antd","Tailwind","暗黑模式","iOS","Linear"],"preview_html":"\n<div onclick=\"if(event.target===this)this.style.display='none'\" style=\"background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);padding:36px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;width:300px\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:600\">提示</span><span onclick=\"this.closest('[onclick]').parentNode.style.display='none'\" style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#999\">✕</span></div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#666;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:20px\">点击遮罩或右上角叉号可关闭弹窗。</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:flex-end\"><button onclick=\"this.closest('[onclick]').parentNode.style.display='none'\" style=\"padding:7px 14px;background:#1677ff;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px\">知道了</button></div>\n  </div>\n</div>","prompt":"设计可关闭提示弹窗：点击遮罩、叉号或按钮均可关闭。","prompt_short":"可关闭提示弹窗：点击遮罩关闭 风格 Modal / 交互 / 关闭 / antd","sort":10,"category_name":"弹窗/抽屉","category_group":"反馈与弹层","prompt_refactor":"把现有页面里的「可关闭提示弹窗」改成这个观感，只改样式，不重写。\n\n技术栈：按我项目现有的（Vue / Quasar 或 React / Tailwind 均可），不要升级版本，不要引入新依赖。\n\n参照描述：\n设计可关闭提示弹窗：点击遮罩、叉号或按钮均可关闭。\n\n约束：\n1. props 名称、数据字段、组件层级一律不动，只调整布局 / 间距 / 字号 / 颜色 / 圆角 / 阴影\n2. 需要动效时用项目已有能力降级实现，不新增动画库\n3. 先给 2-3 个方向（每个方向改了什么、风险在哪），我确认后再出代码\n4. 出代码时给完整单文件版本，不要给 diff\n验收：功能不变，构建能过。风格关键词：Modal / 交互 / 关闭 / antd / Tailwind / 暗黑模式","url":"/v/modal-020/","md_url":"/api/v/modal-020.md","related":[{"slug":"modal-001","name":"shadcn/ui 对话框","tags":["桌面端","弹窗","shadcn"]},{"slug":"modal-002","name":"iOS 底部抽屉","tags":["移动端","iOS","抽屉"]},{"slug":"modal-003","name":"居中确认弹窗","tags":["移动端","确认","弹窗"]},{"slug":"modal-004","name":"侧边滑出抽屉","tags":["桌面端","抽屉","后台"]},{"slug":"modal-005","name":"确认删除弹窗","tags":[